        "text": "Level momentum remains positive, but May's $164.9 billion jump was partly supported by farm proprietors' income after a second round of disaster-relief payments. Normal wage and salary growth supports another increase, while fading relief payments and movements in personal current taxes argue against simply repeating May's gain."
